+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project's recorded decision is to use an LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction strategy with a 300-second time-to-live (TTL): entries are automatically expired 300 seconds after being cached, and when the cache reaches capacity, the least recently used entries are evicted first.
